"nka Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"Niba ubyinjije intoki, menya neza ibi bikurikira:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 amasegonda\n"
"\n"
"Buri gikorwa gifite kode yacyo. Mugihe ushotora igikorwa na SMS, bagomba "
"kongeraho kode ya 6 igezweho ubu kuva muba indangamuntu nyuma yijambo "
"ryibanze."

